ompter  nobody is going to care or listen to you  you need to have emotional commitment  you need to feel the  thing and how important it is while you  are saying it for me  i'm envisioning all of you i'm  envisioning all the entrepreneurs that  i've worked with who have  these amazing ideas and they never get  them out because they can't communicate  and even though i'm sitting here in an  office by myself and there's nobody  around to actually connect with  i'm just talking to a camera i'm trying  to channel you i'm trying to channel all  the people that i've connected with  and seen and i want to make sure that  your business  does well and communicating is so  important as part of that which is why  i'm doing this video and hopefully the  care the love the energy comes through  in the content that i make and so sales  and convincing people  not enough against what they want but in  a positive way like this is something  that you guys can get together on  is about the energy transfer you are not  just selling a concept or an idea you  are transferring energy  whoever is more confident wins whoever  is more convincing wins and it's usually  from  whoever believes in their thing more if  you absolutely believe in your thing and  that this is right and it's for them and  they need to do this thing  because it's in their best interest not  because they're just trying to sell  something  down their throat but you really really  really really care  and if they feel that care as opposed to  just  words that you're saying that's how you  bring them on board  it's great to have the best words but  more important  is the emotional commitment that you  have behind them so the best test with  any of this is watch back  some of your content like watch back  your videos read your newsletters  see the copy on your website look at the  story that you wrote about yourself and  why you started this business  does it get you excited it's like boom  boom boom boom like yes  that's right that's why i do this thing  or do you watch it and you get bored  if you get bored and it doesn't get your  heart beating then do it again  do it again and do it again and do it  again and do it again  you will be one of your best critics you  will be one of your harshest critics  and so being able to look over your  content and get to the point where you  say  wow yeah i'm really proud of that  that's when you start to win and tip  number three is raise mistakes  just make it more important if you want  to move people  so often we're focused just on the  tactics the strategies  here's the five things that you need to  do and people say yeah yeah yeah great i  love those the five things  awesome they write them down and then  they never do anything about it  you need to raise the stakes you have to  make it more important you have to make  me  feel the pressure that if i don't do  this thing that you want me to do  terrible things will happen  right so if i talk about how important  communication is  me just saying communication is really  important as an entrepreneur  here are the three ways to do it it's  not as powerful as  communication is one of the most  important skills that entrepreneurs need  to have because if you  don't learn how to communicate your idea  and get it out there  that idea will die inside you and your  mission will never be realized  and listen that paints a dark picture  that's going to an extreme and the idea  is  not to have hyperbole and make things  bigger than they are  but that's a real case for tons of  entrepreneurs  that if they do not learn how to  communicate properly their ideas will  never get out there and their idea will  die inside them and so your goal if you  want to move people  is to make them realize how big this  thing is for them  if they don't take action you're the  expert you know where the road is going  you see  their future if they continue down that  path they don't see that future  they don't understand i